  "goodToKnow": "Der Nachschub is a fresh supply or supplies, originally of military material: Nachschub an Munition, die Nachschubwege. Colloquially, it's any refill: Nachschub holen (to get more), Nachschub an Bier, Chips, Ideen. From nachschieben (to push after). Supply chains in war or crises depend on reliable Nachschub. It has no plural."
